Ledger Wallet application to restore full ZEC functionality.</description></item><item><title>Stellar (XLM) Mainnet Degraded Service [identified]</title><link>https://stspg.io/g6k4ytnq5ymz</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ledger:2026-07-31T14:51:16.068+02:00</guid><pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 12:51:16 +0000</pubDate><description>Blockdaemon, our infrastructure provider for the Stellar (XLM) network, is experiencing a service issue (see their &lt;a href=&#x27;https://status.blockdaemon.com/incidents/c75v3vzd0q97&#x27;&gt;status page&lt;/a&gt;) that may impact your ability to view complete XLM balances and transaction history, particularly for activity older than the last 100 days. Sending and swapping XLM remain functional, but some balances or older transaction history may appear incomplete until full service is restored. We are working with the provider to restore complete Stellar Mainnet history.</description></item><item><title>Solana (SOL) Mainnet Degraded Service [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/q28xfxqg6xlg</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ledger:2026-07-29T10:57:11.881+02:00</guid><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 08:57:11 +0000</pubDate><description>Fixes have been released for Ledger Wallet Desktop and Ledger Wallet Mobile (Android and iOS) addressing the issue caused by the recent Solana protocol change. Please ensure your Ledger Wallet application is updated to the latest version.</description></item><item><title>Toncoin (TON) Mainnet Service Disruption [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/tg8rq8w0vnm5</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ledger:2026-07-29T08:35:31.729+02:00</guid><pubDate>Wed, 29 Jul 2026 06:35:31 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been resolved.</description></item><item><title>Stellar (XLM) Mainnet Degraded Service [resolved]</title><link>https://stspg.io/yf9lfcwcmgrs</link><guid isPermaLink="false">ledger:2026-07-29T00:40:16.276+02:00</guid><pubDate>Tue, 28 Jul 2026 22:40:16 +0000</pubDate><description>This incident has been reso